#: admin/class-exopite-anti-spam-admin.php
msgid "Spam messages often contain words like \"viagra\" or \"vicodin\". The plugin searches these words in text and textarea fields, if any is found, the submission is rejected. Own words can be added on the \"Blacklist\" settings page (Contact menu)."
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/exopite-anti-spam-admin-display.php
msgid "Own spam words"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/exopite-anti-spam-admin-display.php
msgid "One word or phrase per line, plain text, not case-sensitive. These words are checked in addition to the built-in list in text and textarea fields, if the bad/spam words filtering is activated in the form (\"Anti Spam\" tab). They are stored in the database, so plugin updates do not overwrite them."
msgstr ""

