#: admin/class-exopite-anti-spam-admin.php
msgid "Limit failed attempts"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-exopite-anti-spam-admin.php
#, php-format
msgid "After %1$d failed attempts (e.g. wrong image captcha, honeypot, token error) within %2$d minutes, the IP address of the visitor is blocked for %3$d minutes. This prevents bots from guessing the image captcha. The IP address is only stored as a hash in a temporary entry. Deactivate this, if the website is behind a proxy or CDN, which does not pass the IP address of the visitors (all visitors would have the same IP address)."
msgstr ""

